50"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #550","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-550.jpg","content":"Joe Kay goes through all of his favorite slowed edit tracks.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-05-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"DkMOj5ZdPhc","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Donell Jones - U Know What's Up (Without Left Eye)","track":{"id":"fPTllOWKY1o","path":"/artists/donell-jones/tracks/u-know-what-s-up-without-left-eye/","slug":"u-know-whats-up-without-left-eye","title":"U Know What's Up (Without Left Eye)","artist":{"slug":"donell-jones","title":"Donell Jones"},"artwork":"images/artists/donell-jones/tracks/u-know-what-s-up-without-left-eye.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"3k5c0RzMNro","position":89,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Donell Jones - All About You","track":{"id":"Z9JiBTc4qG4","path":"/artists/donell-jones/tracks/all-about-you/","slug":"all-about-you","title":"All About You","artist":{"slug":"donell-jones","title":"Donell Jones"},"artwork":"images/artists/donell-jones/tracks/all-about-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"PHvlQ2uOKUQ","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Donell Jones - Life Goes On (SevnthWonder's Classic OG Remix)","track":{"id":"bh2XIDCdOqU","path":"/artists/donell-jones/tracks/life-goes-on-sevnthwonder-s-classic-og-remix/","slug":"life-goes-on-sevnthwonders-classic-og-remix","title":"Life Goes On (SevnthWonder's Classic OG Remix)","artist":{"slug":"donell-jones","title":"Donell Jones"},"artwork":"images/artists/donell-jones/tracks/life-goes-on-sevnthwonder-s-classic-og-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power's Set","position":1}},{"id":"x7yEBR32sak","position":63,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Donell Jones - All About You","track":{"id":"Z9JiBTc4qG4","path":"/artists/donell-jones/tracks/all-about-you/","slug":"all-about-you","title":"All About You","artist":{"slug":"donell-jones","title":"Donell Jones"},"artwork":"images/artists/donell-jones/tracks/all-about-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"FHFqKOAZRmk","slug":"209","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-209-live-from-soho-house-toronto"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #209 (Live From Soho House Toronto)","artwork":"/images/episodes/209.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-03-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"UjasYFuer58","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Donell Jones - Have You Seen Her","track":{"id":"XxDViYieM-M","path":"/artists/donell-jones/tracks/have-you-seen-her/","slug":"have-you-seen-her","title":"Have You Seen Her","artist":{"slug":"donell-jones","title":"Donell Jones"},"artwork":"images/artists/donell-jones/tracks/have-you-seen-her.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"hk43f64dZcE","slug":"242","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-242/ra.1076038133","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-242-w-ginuwine"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #242 w/ Ginuwine","artwork":"/images/episodes/242.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-